===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|RS}}====
In ''[[AG119|The Ribbon Cup Caper]]'', [[Brodie]] disguised himself as a woman that resembled the {{game2|Ruby|Sapphire|Emerald}} depiction of this Trainer class.

====[[Pokémon movie]]s====
A Lady appeared at the beginning of ''[[M06|Jirachi: Wish Maker]]'', having a {{pkmn|battle}} with {{ga|Brendan}}. The same Lady made a cameo in ''[[M11|Giratina and the Sky Warrior]]'' with {{p|Eevee}} and seven of its [[Eeveelution|Evolutions]]. She is based on the Lady from Pokémon Ruby, Sapphire, and Emerald.

A Lady appeared with her {{p|Espeon}} in ''[[M07|Destiny Deoxys]]''.

===={{aniseries|DP}}====
In ''[[DP076|A Full Course Tag Battle!]]'', [[Kylie]] is based on the {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s}} sprite for a Lady, just as [[Roman]] is based on the {{tc|Rich Boy}} Trainer class.

===={{aniseries|JN}}====
In ''[[JN047|Crowning the Chow Crusher!]]'', a Lady was among the contestants that entered the [[Pokémon Grand Eating Contest]]. Though she managed to get past the first round, her {{p|Vigoroth}} was unable to continue due to {{TRT}} feeding it tampered cookies that filled up its stomach.

