====History====
====={{MangaArc|FireRed & LeafGreen}}=====
{{main|Selphy}}
Selphy made a brief cameo with her butler, Sebastian in ''[[PS278|Put Your Beast Foot Forward]]''.

====={{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}}=====
A Lady was one of the people swarming the [[Mossdeep Space Center]] in ''[[PS606|Diancie Shines]]''.

====={{MangaArc|Diamond & Pearl}}=====
In ''[[PS351|Perturbed by Pachirisu]]'', a Lady appeared as one of the participants of a {{pkmn|Super Contest}} that {{adv|Platinum}} also participated in. Despite the Lady's {{p|Pachirisu}} messing up the contents of Platinum's [[Fashion Case]], Platinum got first place in the Super Contest.

In ''[[PS361|Bombastic Bibarel & Heroic Hippopotas]]'', a Lady appeared in the Seven Stars Restaurant with a Rich Boy. Another Lady and her {{p|Pachirisu}}, who are not very attached to each other, appeared as an example of [[Dr. Footstep]]'s explanation that [[footprint]]s can be used to discern how a Pokémon is attached to its Trainer.

====={{MangaArc|Platinum}}=====
In ''[[PS418|Deprogramming Porygon-Z]]'', a Lady challenging the [[Battle Castle]] was shown with her {{p|Gardevoir}}.

====={{MangaArc|Black & White}}=====
In ''[[PS466|An Odd Speech]]'', a Lady was seen listening to [[Ghetsis]]'s speech.

====={{MangaArc|X & Y}}=====
In ''[[PS554|Kangaskhan...Kangascan't]]'', a Lady and her {{p|Goomy}} appeared at [[Santalune City]].

A Lady was seen in {{adv|Blue}}'s flashback in ''[[PS582|Pinsir Glares]]''.

